```plaintext
CLASS SearchEngine
    FUNCTION search_books(query: string, book_manager: BookManager) RETURNS list of Book
        RETURN [book FOR EACH book IN book_manager.books IF (query.lower() IN book.title.lower())]
    END FUNCTION
END CLASS
